    {
      "id": "slide-1",
      "number": 1,
      "part": "WELCOME",
      "partKey": "part_welcome",
      "title": "MODULE 04 • MODERN CSS",
      "html": "<section class=\"slide-item active w-full max-w-7xl h-full mx-auto flex flex-col justify-center items-center\" data-part=\"WELCOME\" data-part-key=\"part_welcome\" id=\"slide-1\">\n  <div class=\"slide-content-card title-card-hero w-full max-w-7xl h-[80%] min-h-[80%] bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 flex flex-col gap-4 shadow-2xl overflow-y-auto\">\n    <div class=\"title-hero-grid grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1.15fr_0.85fr] gap-4 items-center\">\n      <div class=\"title-text-col\">\n        <div class=\"title-badge-pill\">MODULE 04 • MODERN CSS</div>\n        <h1 class=\"title-main-h1 text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white m-0 mb-1 leading-tight\">Tailwind CSS<br><span class=\"title-accent text-blue-400 font-extrabold\">Rapid Utility-First Styling</span></h1>\n        <p class=\"title-tagline text-sm text-slate-300 italic m-0 mb-3\">“Build modern, responsive interfaces directly in your markup”</p>\n        <div class=\"alert-callout tip flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 border border-sky-500/30 bg-sky-500/10 text-sky-300 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed\"><div>Master utility classes, flexbox/grid layouts, responsive breakpoints, design tokens, and dark mode without writing raw CSS.</div></div>\n        <div class=\"title-actions-row\"><button class=\"btn-cta-primary inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 border border-blue-600 text-white text-xs font-bold cursor-pointer transition-colors no-underline\" id=\"btn-start-course\">Start Module <svg class=\"inline-arrow w-3 h-3 shrink-0 inline-block align-middle mx-1 text-slate-500\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M6.22 3.22a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0l4.25 4.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-4.25 4.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06-1.06L9.94 8 6.22 4.28a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06z\"/></svg></button><span class=\"cta-hint\">or press <kbd>Space</kbd> / <kbd>→</kbd></span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"title-visual-col\">\n        <div class=\"code-box bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 overflow-hidden font-mono text-xs shadow-md\"><div class=\"code-box-header flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2 bg-slate-900 border-b border-slate-800\"><span>HeroCard.tsx</span></div><pre><code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">&lt;div className=\"p-6 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl shadow-xl flex items-center gap-4 hover:border-blue-500 transition-all\"&gt;\n  &lt;div className=\"w-12 h-12 bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center font-bold\"&gt;\n    TS\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;div&gt;\n    &lt;h3 className=\"text-lg font-bold text-white\"&gt;Tailwind CSS&lt;/h3&gt;\n    &lt;p className=\"text-sm text-slate-400\"&gt;Utility-First Framework&lt;/p&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;</code></pre></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-2",
      "number": 2,
      "part": "OVERVIEW",
      "partKey": "",
      "title": "Why Utility-First CSS?",
      "html": "<section class=\"slide-item w-full max-w-7xl h-full mx-auto flex-col justify-center items-center\" data-part=\"OVERVIEW\" id=\"slide-2\">\n  <div class=\"slide-content-card w-full max-w-7xl h-[80%] min-h-[80%] bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 flex flex-col gap-4 shadow-2xl overflow-y-auto\">\n    <div class=\"slide-header-group flex items-start justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-3 gap-3\"><span class=\"slide-category-tag font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-400\">OVERVIEW</span><h2 class=\"slide-title text-2xl font-extrabold text-white m-0 leading-tight\">Why Utility-First CSS?</h2><p class=\"slide-subtitle text-[13px] text-slate-400 m-0\">How utility classes solve the classic pitfalls of traditional CSS files</p></div>\n    <div class=\"slide-grid-2 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n      <div class=\"info-card bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-800 p-3.5 flex flex-col gap-2 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors\">\n        <h4><span class=\"cross-icon inline-flex items-center justify-center text-red-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M3.72 3.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0L8 6.94l3.22-3.22a.75.75 0 1 1 1.06 1.06L9.06 8l3.22 3.22a.75.75 0 1 1-1.06 1.06L8 9.06l-3.22 3.22a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06-1.06L6.94 8 3.72 4.78a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06z\"/></svg></span> Traditional CSS File Nightmare</h4>\n        <p>You waste hours thinking of class names (<code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">.header-nav-card-item-inner</code>). The CSS file grows infinitely because you fear deleting unused rules.</p>\n        <div class=\"alert-callout flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 border border-slate-700 bg-slate-800/80 text-slate-300 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed\"><div>Result: Global naming collisions, style leakage, bloated CSS bundle.</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"info-card bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-800 p-3.5 flex flex-col gap-2 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors\">\n        <h4><span class=\"check-icon inline-flex items-center justify-center text-green-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg></span> Tailwind Utility-First Superpower</h4>\n        <p>You style directly inside your markup with predefined constraints. Purges unused classes automatically for a tiny ~10kB production stylesheet.</p>\n        <div class=\"alert-callout tip flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 border border-sky-500/30 bg-sky-500/10 text-sky-300 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed\"><div>No context switching between HTML and CSS files. Consistent spacing and colors.</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-3",
      "number": 3,
      "part": "SETUP",
      "partKey": "",
      "title": "Configuration &amp; Setup",
      "html": "<section class=\"slide-item w-full max-w-7xl h-full mx-auto flex-col justify-center items-center\" data-part=\"SETUP\" id=\"slide-3\">\n  <div class=\"slide-content-card w-full max-w-7xl h-[80%] min-h-[80%] bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 flex flex-col gap-4 shadow-2xl overflow-y-auto\">\n    <div class=\"slide-header-group flex items-start justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-3 gap-3\"><span class=\"slide-category-tag font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-400\">SETUP</span><h2 class=\"slide-title text-2xl font-extrabold text-white m-0 leading-tight\">Configuration &amp; Setup</h2><p class=\"slide-subtitle text-[13px] text-slate-400 m-0\">Importing Tailwind directives into your project</p></div>\n    <div class=\"slide-grid-2 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n      <div class=\"code-box bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 overflow-hidden font-mono text-xs shadow-md\"><div class=\"code-box-header flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2 bg-slate-900 border-b border-slate-800\"><span>src/app/globals.css</span><button class=\"copy-btn text-[11px] px-2 py-0.5 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-1 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-slate-700 transition-colors\">Copy</button></div><pre><code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">@import \"tailwindcss\";\n\n@theme {\n  --color-brand-primary: #2563eb;\n  --color-brand-accent: #6366f1;\n  --font-display: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;\n}</code></pre></div>\n      <div class=\"terminal-mockup bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 overflow-hidden font-mono text-xs shadow-md\"><div class=\"terminal-header flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2 bg-slate-900 border-b border-slate-800\"><div class=\"terminal-dots flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span class=\"dot red\"></span><span class=\"dot yellow\"></span><span class=\"dot green\"></span></div><span class=\"terminal-title text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-semibold\">bash — install tailwind</span><button class=\"copy-btn text-[11px] px-2 py-0.5 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-1 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-slate-700 transition-colors\">Copy</button></div><div class=\"terminal-body p-3 overflow-x-auto text-slate-200 leading-relaxed font-mono text-xs\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term-prompt text-blue-500 select-none mr-2 font-bold\">$</span><span class=\"term-cmd text-blue-400 font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5\">pnpm add tailwindcss @tailwindcss/postcss postcss</span></div><div class=\"term-output text-slate-300 font-mono text-xs\">+ tailwindcss 4.0.0<br>+ @tailwindcss/postcss 4.0.0<br><span class=\"out-success\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"inline-block align-middle mr-0.5\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg>Packages installed successfully</span></div></div></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-4",
      "number": 4,
      "part": "UTILITIES",
      "partKey": "",
      "title": "Sizing &amp; Spacing System",
      "html": "<section class=\"slide-item w-full max-w-7xl h-full mx-auto flex-col justify-center items-center\" data-part=\"UTILITIES\" id=\"slide-4\">\n  <div class=\"slide-content-card w-full max-w-7xl h-[80%] min-h-[80%] bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 flex flex-col gap-4 shadow-2xl overflow-y-auto\">\n    <div class=\"slide-header-group flex items-start justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-3 gap-3\"><span class=\"slide-category-tag font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-400\">UTILITIES</span><h2 class=\"slide-title text-2xl font-extrabold text-white m-0 leading-tight\">Sizing &amp; Spacing System</h2><p class=\"slide-subtitle text-[13px] text-slate-400 m-0\">Fixed mathematical scale for margins, paddings, and dimensions</p></div>\n    <div class=\"clean-table-container w-full overflow-x-auto border border-slate-800\">\n      <table class=\"clean-table w-full border-collapse text-xs border border-slate-800\">\n        <thead><tr><th class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left font-bold text-slate-300 bg-slate-800 border-b border-slate-700\">Utility Class</th><th class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left font-bold text-slate-300 bg-slate-800 border-b border-slate-700\">CSS Value</th><th class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left font-bold text-slate-300 bg-slate-800 border-b border-slate-700\">Pixel Equivalent</th><th class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left font-bold text-slate-300 bg-slate-800 border-b border-slate-700\">Usage Example</th></tr></thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\"><code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">p-1</code> / <code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">m-1</code></td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\">0.25rem</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\">4px</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\">Micro gap, button tags</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\"><code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">p-2</code> / <code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">m-2</code></td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\">0.5rem</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\">8px</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\">Small pill badges</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\"><code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">p-3</code> / <code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">m-3</code></td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\">0.75rem</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\">12px</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\">Input fields</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\"><code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">p-4</code> / <code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">m-4</code></td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\">1rem</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\">16px</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\">Standard card padding</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\"><code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">p-5</code> / <code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">m-5</code></td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\">1.25rem</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\">20px</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\">Section card containers</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\"><code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">w-full</code> / <code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">max-w-xl</code></td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\">100% / 36rem</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\">Full width with cap</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\">Responsive containers</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-5",
      "number": 5,
      "part": "TYPOGRAPHY",
      "partKey": "",
      "title": "Typography &amp; Modern Colors",
      "html": "<section class=\"slide-item w-full max-w-7xl h-full mx-auto flex-col justify-center items-center\" data-part=\"TYPOGRAPHY\" id=\"slide-5\">\n  <div class=\"slide-content-card w-full max-w-7xl h-[80%] min-h-[80%] bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 flex flex-col gap-4 shadow-2xl overflow-y-auto\">\n    <div class=\"slide-header-group flex items-start justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-3 gap-3\"><span class=\"slide-category-tag font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-400\">TYPOGRAPHY</span><h2 class=\"slide-title text-2xl font-extrabold text-white m-0 leading-tight\">Typography &amp; Modern Colors</h2><p class=\"slide-subtitle text-[13px] text-slate-400 m-0\">Pre-curated contrast and hierarchy</p></div>\n    <div class=\"slide-grid-2 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n      <div class=\"code-box bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 overflow-hidden font-mono text-xs shadow-md\"><div class=\"code-box-header flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2 bg-slate-900 border-b border-slate-800\"><span>Typography Classes</span></div><pre><code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">&lt;h1 className=\"text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white\"&gt;\n  Main Heading\n&lt;/h1&gt;\n&lt;h2 className=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-200 mt-2\"&gt;\n  Subtitle Heading\n&lt;/h2&gt;\n&lt;p className=\"text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mt-1\"&gt;\n  Descriptive paragraph text with balanced line height.\n&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;span className=\" text-xs text-blue-400\"&gt;\n  git status\n&lt;/span&gt;</code></pre></div>\n      <div class=\"info-card bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-800 p-3.5 flex flex-col gap-2 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors\">\n        <h4>Color Palette Rules</h4>\n        <p>1. Backgrounds: <code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">bg-slate-900</code>, <code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">bg-slate-950</code>, <code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">bg-white</code></p>\n        <p>2. Text: <code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">text-slate-100</code> (primary), <code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">text-slate-400</code> (muted)</p>\n        <p>3. Accents: <code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">text-blue-400</code>, <code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">bg-blue-500</code>, <code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">border-blue-500/30</code></p>\n        <p>4. Borders: <code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">border-slate-800</code>, <code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">border-slate-200</code></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-6",
      "number": 6,
      "part": "LAYOUT",
      "partKey": "",
      "title": "Flexbox &amp; CSS Grid in Action",
      "html": "<section class=\"slide-item w-full max-w-7xl h-full mx-auto flex-col justify-center items-center\" data-part=\"LAYOUT\" id=\"slide-6\">\n  <div class=\"slide-content-card w-full max-w-7xl h-[80%] min-h-[80%] bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 flex flex-col gap-4 shadow-2xl overflow-y-auto\">\n    <div class=\"slide-header-group flex items-start justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-3 gap-3\"><span class=\"slide-category-tag font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-400\">LAYOUT</span><h2 class=\"slide-title text-2xl font-extrabold text-white m-0 leading-tight\">Flexbox &amp; CSS Grid in Action</h2><p class=\"slide-subtitle text-[13px] text-slate-400 m-0\">Building responsive 2-column and 3-column card layouts</p></div>\n    <div class=\"code-box bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 overflow-hidden font-mono text-xs shadow-md\"><div class=\"code-box-header flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2 bg-slate-900 border-b border-slate-800\"><span>Responsive Grid Layout</span><button class=\"copy-btn text-[11px] px-2 py-0.5 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-1 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-slate-700 transition-colors\">Copy</button></div><pre><code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">{/* Responsive 1 col on mobile, 3 cols on desktop */}\n&lt;div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4\"&gt;\n  {features.map((item) =&gt; (\n    &lt;div \n      key={item.id}\n      className=\"flex flex-col justify-between p-4 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl\"\n    &gt;\n      &lt;div className=\"flex items-center justify-between\"&gt;\n        &lt;span className=\"text-xs  text-blue-400\"&gt;{item.tag}&lt;/span&gt;\n        &lt;span className=\"text-xs text-slate-500\"&gt;{item.date}&lt;/span&gt;\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;h3 className=\"text-base font-bold text-white mt-2\"&gt;{item.title}&lt;/h3&gt;\n      &lt;p className=\"text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1\"&gt;{item.desc}&lt;/p&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n  ))}\n&lt;/div&gt;</code></pre></div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-7",
      "number": 7,
      "part": "RESPONSIVE",
      "partKey": "",
      "title": "Mobile-First Breakpoint Architecture",
      "html": "<section class=\"slide-item w-full max-w-7xl h-full mx-auto flex-col justify-center items-center\" data-part=\"RESPONSIVE\" id=\"slide-7\">\n  <div class=\"slide-content-card w-full max-w-7xl h-[80%] min-h-[80%] bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 flex flex-col gap-4 shadow-2xl overflow-y-auto\">\n    <div class=\"slide-header-group flex items-start justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-3 gap-3\"><span class=\"slide-category-tag font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-400\">RESPONSIVE</span><h2 class=\"slide-title text-2xl font-extrabold text-white m-0 leading-tight\">Mobile-First Breakpoint Architecture</h2><p class=\"slide-subtitle text-[13px] text-slate-400 m-0\">Styles apply to mobile first, then scale up with prefixes</p></div>\n    <div class=\"clean-table-container w-full overflow-x-auto border border-slate-800\">\n      <table class=\"clean-table w-full border-collapse text-xs border border-slate-800\">\n        <thead><tr><th class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left font-bold text-slate-300 bg-slate-800 border-b border-slate-700\">Prefix</th><th class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left font-bold text-slate-300 bg-slate-800 border-b border-slate-700\">Minimum Width</th><th class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left font-bold text-slate-300 bg-slate-800 border-b border-slate-700\">CSS Media Query</th><th class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left font-bold text-slate-300 bg-slate-800 border-b border-slate-700\">Target Device</th></tr></thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\">(default)</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\">0px</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\">(mobile first)</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\">All smartphones</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\"><code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">sm:</code></td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\">640px</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\"><code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">@media (min-width: 640px)</code></td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\">Large phones / small tablets</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\"><code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">md:</code></td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\">768px</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\"><code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">@media (min-width: 768px)</code></td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\">Tablets / iPad</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\"><code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">lg:</code></td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\">1024px</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\"><code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">@media (min-width: 1024px)</code></td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\">Laptops / Desktops</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\"><code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">xl:</code></td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\">1280px</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\"><code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">@media (min-width: 1280px)</code></td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-200\">Large desktop monitors</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"alert-callout tip flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 border border-sky-500/30 bg-sky-500/10 text-sky-300 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed\"><div>Example: <code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">className=\"w-full md:w-1/2 lg:w-1/3\"</code> makes a column full width on phones, half width on tablets, and one third on desktop.</div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-8",
      "number": 8,
      "part": "STATES",
      "partKey": "",
      "title": "Interactive Hover, Focus &amp; Active States",
      "html": "<section class=\"slide-item w-full max-w-7xl h-full mx-auto flex-col justify-center items-center\" data-part=\"STATES\" id=\"slide-8\">\n  <div class=\"slide-content-card w-full max-w-7xl h-[80%] min-h-[80%] bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 flex flex-col gap-4 shadow-2xl overflow-y-auto\">\n    <div class=\"slide-header-group flex items-start justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-3 gap-3\"><span class=\"slide-category-tag font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-400\">STATES</span><h2 class=\"slide-title text-2xl font-extrabold text-white m-0 leading-tight\">Interactive Hover, Focus &amp; Active States</h2><p class=\"slide-subtitle text-[13px] text-slate-400 m-0\">Polished micro-animations with transition utilities</p></div>\n    <div class=\"code-box bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 overflow-hidden font-mono text-xs shadow-md\"><div class=\"code-box-header flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2 bg-slate-900 border-b border-slate-800\"><span>Interactive Button Component</span><button class=\"copy-btn text-[11px] px-2 py-0.5 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-1 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-slate-700 transition-colors\">Copy</button></div><pre><code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">&lt;button className=\"\n  px-4 py-2 \n  bg-blue-600 text-white font-bold text-sm \n  rounded-lg \n  hover:bg-blue-500 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-blue-500/25 \n  focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-400 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-offset-slate-950\n  active:scale-95 \n  transition-all duration-150 ease-out\n\"&gt;\n  Submit Form <svg class=\"inline-arrow w-3 h-3 shrink-0 inline-block align-middle mx-1 text-slate-500\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M6.22 3.22a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0l4.25 4.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-4.25 4.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06-1.06L9.94 8 6.22 4.28a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06z\"/></svg>\n&lt;/button&gt;</code></pre></div>\n    <div class=\"alert-callout flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 border border-slate-700 bg-slate-800/80 text-slate-300 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed\"><div>Always include <code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">focus:ring-2</code> for keyboard accessibility and <code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">transition-all</code> for smooth visual feedback.</div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-9",
      "number": 9,
      "part": "DARK MODE",
      "partKey": "",
      "title": "Tailwind Dark Mode Integration",
      "html": "<section class=\"slide-item w-full max-w-7xl h-full mx-auto flex-col justify-center items-center\" data-part=\"DARK MODE\" id=\"slide-9\">\n  <div class=\"slide-content-card w-full max-w-7xl h-[80%] min-h-[80%] bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 flex flex-col gap-4 shadow-2xl overflow-y-auto\">\n    <div class=\"slide-header-group flex items-start justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-3 gap-3\"><span class=\"slide-category-tag font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-400\">DARK MODE</span><h2 class=\"slide-title text-2xl font-extrabold text-white m-0 leading-tight\">Tailwind Dark Mode Integration</h2><p class=\"slide-subtitle text-[13px] text-slate-400 m-0\">Effortless dual-theme support using the dark: variant</p></div>\n    <div class=\"code-box bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 overflow-hidden font-mono text-xs shadow-md\"><div class=\"code-box-header flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2 bg-slate-900 border-b border-slate-800\"><span>Dual-Theme Card Example</span><button class=\"copy-btn text-[11px] px-2 py-0.5 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-1 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-slate-700 transition-colors\">Copy</button></div><pre><code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">&lt;div className=\"\n  bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 \n  text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 \n  border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 \n  rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm\n\"&gt;\n  &lt;h3 className=\"text-lg font-bold\"&gt;Project Status&lt;/h3&gt;\n  &lt;p className=\"text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1\"&gt;\n    Automatically adapts when the user switches themes.\n  &lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;</code></pre></div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-10",
      "number": 10,
      "part": "COMPONENTS",
      "partKey": "",
      "title": "Reusable Component Extraction",
      "html": "<section class=\"slide-item w-full max-w-7xl h-full mx-auto flex-col justify-center items-center\" data-part=\"COMPONENTS\" id=\"slide-10\">\n  <div class=\"slide-content-card w-full max-w-7xl h-[80%] min-h-[80%] bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 flex flex-col gap-4 shadow-2xl overflow-y-auto\">\n    <div class=\"slide-header-group flex items-start justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-3 gap-3\"><span class=\"slide-category-tag font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-400\">COMPONENTS</span><h2 class=\"slide-title text-2xl font-extrabold text-white m-0 leading-tight\">Reusable Component Extraction</h2><p class=\"slide-subtitle text-[13px] text-slate-400 m-0\">How to avoid class string duplication in React</p></div>\n    <div class=\"slide-grid-2 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n      <div class=\"info-card bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-800 p-3.5 flex flex-col gap-2 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors\">\n        <h4><span class=\"cross-icon inline-flex items-center justify-center text-red-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M3.72 3.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0L8 6.94l3.22-3.22a.75.75 0 1 1 1.06 1.06L9.06 8l3.22 3.22a.75.75 0 1 1-1.06 1.06L8 9.06l-3.22 3.22a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06-1.06L6.94 8 3.72 4.78a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06z\"/></svg></span> Don't Overuse @apply</h4>\n        <p>Do not create hundreds of custom CSS classes with <code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">@apply</code>. That defeats the purpose of utility-first CSS and creates a bloated stylesheet.</p>\n        <div class=\"alert-callout flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 border border-slate-700 bg-slate-800/80 text-slate-300 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed\"><div>Only use @apply for global HTML element resets.</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"info-card bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-800 p-3.5 flex flex-col gap-2 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors\">\n        <h4><span class=\"check-icon inline-flex items-center justify-center text-green-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg></span> Extract React Components</h4>\n        <p>Wrap repeated markup in reusable components like <code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">&lt;Button variant=\"primary\" /&gt;</code> or <code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">&lt;Card /&gt;</code>.</p>\n        <div class=\"alert-callout tip flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 border border-sky-500/30 bg-sky-500/10 text-sky-300 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed\"><div>This leads directly into modern component libraries like Shadcn UI!</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-11",
      "number": 11,
      "part": "BEST PRACTICES",
      "partKey": "",
      "title": "Tailwind Developer Best Practices",
      "html": "<section class=\"slide-item w-full max-w-7xl h-full mx-auto flex-col justify-center items-center\" data-part=\"BEST PRACTICES\" id=\"slide-11\">\n  <div class=\"slide-content-card w-full max-w-7xl h-[80%] min-h-[80%] bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 flex flex-col gap-4 shadow-2xl overflow-y-auto\">\n    <div class=\"slide-header-group flex items-start justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-3 gap-3\"><span class=\"slide-category-tag font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-400\">BEST PRACTICES</span><h2 class=\"slide-title text-2xl font-extrabold text-white m-0 leading-tight\">Tailwind Developer Best Practices</h2><p class=\"slide-subtitle text-[13px] text-slate-400 m-0\">Writing clean, maintainable utility markup</p></div>\n    <div class=\"summary-checklist-grid\">\n      <div class=\"checklist-item flex items-start gap-2.5 p-2.5 bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-300\"><span class=\"check-icon inline-flex items-center justify-center text-green-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg></span><span>Order classes logically: Layout <svg class=\"inline-arrow w-3 h-3 shrink-0 inline-block align-middle mx-1 text-slate-500\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M6.22 3.22a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0l4.25 4.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-4.25 4.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06-1.06L9.94 8 6.22 4.28a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06z\"/></svg> Spacing <svg class=\"inline-arrow w-3 h-3 shrink-0 inline-block align-middle mx-1 text-slate-500\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M6.22 3.22a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0l4.25 4.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-4.25 4.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06-1.06L9.94 8 6.22 4.28a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06z\"/></svg> Typography <svg class=\"inline-arrow w-3 h-3 shrink-0 inline-block align-middle mx-1 text-slate-500\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M6.22 3.22a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0l4.25 4.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-4.25 4.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06-1.06L9.94 8 6.22 4.28a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06z\"/></svg> Colors <svg class=\"inline-arrow w-3 h-3 shrink-0 inline-block align-middle mx-1 text-slate-500\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M6.22 3.22a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0l4.25 4.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-4.25 4.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06-1.06L9.94 8 6.22 4.28a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06z\"/></svg> States</span></div>\n      <div class=\"checklist-item flex items-start gap-2.5 p-2.5 bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-300\"><span class=\"check-icon inline-flex items-center justify-center text-green-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg></span><span>Install Tailwind CSS IntelliSense extension in VS Code / IDE</span></div>\n      <div class=\"checklist-item flex items-start gap-2.5 p-2.5 bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-300\"><span class=\"check-icon inline-flex items-center justify-center text-green-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg></span><span>Use arbitrary values (<code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">w-[350px]</code>) sparingly; stick to the scale</span></div>\n      <div class=\"checklist-item flex items-start gap-2.5 p-2.5 bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-300\"><span class=\"check-icon inline-flex items-center justify-center text-green-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg></span><span>Use opacity modifiers like <code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">bg-blue-500/20</code> for sleek glows</span></div>\n      <div class=\"checklist-item flex items-start gap-2.5 p-2.5 bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-300\"><span class=\"check-icon inline-flex items-center justify-center text-green-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg></span><span>Ensure high contrast in both Light Mode and Dark Mode</span></div>\n      <div class=\"checklist-item flex items-start gap-2.5 p-2.5 bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-300\"><span class=\"check-icon inline-flex items-center justify-center text-green-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg></span><span>Use the <code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">cn()</code> utility helper to merge conditional classes</span></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-12",
      "number": 12,
      "part": "SUMMARY",
      "partKey": "",
      "title": "Tailwind CSS Mastery Checklist",
      "html": "<section class=\"slide-item w-full max-w-7xl h-full mx-auto flex-col justify-center items-center\" data-part=\"SUMMARY\" id=\"slide-12\">\n  <div class=\"slide-content-card summary-card w-full max-w-7xl h-[80%] min-h-[80%] bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 flex flex-col gap-4 shadow-2xl overflow-y-auto\">\n    <div class=\"slide-header-group flex items-start justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-3 gap-3\"><span class=\"slide-category-tag font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-400\">SUMMARY</span><h2 class=\"slide-title text-2xl font-extrabold text-white m-0 leading-tight\">Tailwind CSS Mastery Checklist</h2><p class=\"slide-subtitle text-[13px] text-slate-400 m-0\">You now have full control of modern utility styling</p></div>\n    <div class=\"summary-checklist-grid\">\n      <div class=\"checklist-item flex items-start gap-2.5 p-2.5 bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-300\"><span class=\"check-icon inline-flex items-center justify-center text-green-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg></span><span>Utility-first philosophy: fast, scoped, zero CSS sprawl</span></div>\n      <div class=\"checklist-item flex items-start gap-2.5 p-2.5 bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-300\"><span class=\"check-icon inline-flex items-center justify-center text-green-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg></span><span>Sizing and spacing scale (p-1 to p-5)</span></div>\n      <div class=\"checklist-item flex items-start gap-2.5 p-2.5 bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-300\"><span class=\"check-icon inline-flex items-center justify-center text-green-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg></span><span>Flexbox and Grid responsive column layouts</span></div>\n      <div class=\"checklist-item flex items-start gap-2.5 p-2.5 bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-300\"><span class=\"check-icon inline-flex items-center justify-center text-green-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg></span><span>Mobile-first responsive breakpoints (sm, md, lg, xl)</span></div>\n      <div class=\"checklist-item flex items-start gap-2.5 p-2.5 bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-300\"><span class=\"check-icon inline-flex items-center justify-center text-green-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg></span><span>Micro-interactions with hover, focus, and transition</span></div>\n      <div class=\"checklist-item flex items-start gap-2.5 p-2.5 bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-300\"><span class=\"check-icon inline-flex items-center justify-center text-green-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg></span><span>Seamless dark mode with dark: modifiers</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"quote-banner p-3 bg-slate-800/60 border-l-4 border-blue-500 text-slate-300 italic text-xs leading-relaxed\">Next step: Combine Tailwind with accessible Radix primitives in Shadcn UI!</div>\n    <div class=\"mt-4 text-center\"><a href=\"shadcn.html\" class=\"btn-cta-primary inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 border border-blue-600 text-white text-xs font-bold cursor-pointer transition-colors no-underline\">Continue to Lesson 05: Shadcn UI <svg class=\"inline-arrow w-3 h-3 shrink-0 inline-block align-middle mx-1 text-slate-500\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M6.22 3.22a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0l4.25 4.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-4.25 4.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06-1.06L9.94 8 6.22 4.28a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06z\"/></svg></a></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n      </div>"
    }
